{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"MRK","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤔᤷᤁᤢᤛ","commonName":"ᤔᤷᤁᤢᤛ","title":"ᤔᤷᤁᤢᤛᤖᤧ ᤛᤠᤵᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤛᤢᤏᤠᤀᤡᤱ","order":41,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"b2060868822844e783adc1c46e31426b08db82e9e63c16700ae81ee716def694","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/MRK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/MRK/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":661},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤡᤶᤔᤡᤴ ᤕ᤺"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤕᤧᤛᤢ᤺ᤴ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤡᤶᤔᤥᤗᤠᤶ ᤗ᤺ᤴᤍᤧᤖ ᤐᤳᤇᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤜᤢ᤹ᤛᤠᤶᤒᤠᤎᤡᤰᤗᤧ ᤔᤧᤳᤋᤢ. “ᤀᤠᤍᤠᤱᤒᤠ ᤛᤡᤰᤛᤠᤶᤒᤣ. ᤀᤠᤰᤂᤧᤴ ᤕᤔᤩᤶᤒᤠ ᤗᤢᤱᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤢ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤁᤧᤔᤠᤒᤠ ᤜᤡᤶᤜᤠ᤹ᤏᤧᤒᤣ. ᤀᤥᤔᤧᤳᤋᤧ᤹ᤏᤠ᥄”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤏᤥᤃᤵ ᤐᤡᤖᤢ. “ᤁᤴ ᤁᤧᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤶᤒᤠ ᤜᤡᤶᤜᤠ᤹ ᤌᤡᤰ ᤗᤢᤱᤛᤶᤍᤠᤱ ᤘᤣ᤹ ᤗᤢᤱᤎᤡᤰᤁᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤴᤏᤧᤀᤣ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤔᤧᤕ᤺ ᤔᤧᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤗᤥ॥”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ᤺ᤴ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤡᤶᤔᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤏᤠᤎᤠ᤺ᤶᤒᤡ ᤈᤤᤋᤢᤏ ᤁᤥ᤺ᤰᤔᤠᤀᤥ ᤘᤕᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤜᤢ᤹ᤛᤠᤶᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤐᤋᤪᤢᤛ. ᤕᤠᤁᤢᤒ. ᤕᤢᤜᤢᤴᤏᤠ ᤏᤢ ᤀᤠᤴᤍᤪᤡᤕᤠᤛᤖᤧ ᤛᤫᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤠᤱ ᤂᤢᤏᤧ᤹ ᤀᤰᤂᤣᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤴᤔᤧᤍᤥᤛᤢ."]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["“ᤛᤡᤰᤛᤠᤶᤒᤣ. ᤁᤴ ᤁᤧᤖᤧᤰ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤜᤠ᤹ ᤀᤠᤵᤑᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤒᤠᤒᤣ᥅ ᤁᤴ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤔᤠᤏᤢ᤺ᤸᤗᤧ ᤋᤃᤡ ᤌᤣ ᤔᤡᤰᤛᤣ᤺ᤴ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤒᤣ᥅ ᤕᤠᤵᤔᤡ ᤀᤠᤔᤧᤳᤋᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤥᤃᤵ ᤐᤡᤖᤢᤛᤡ. “ᤛᤡᤱᤛᤡᤱ ᤗ᤹ᤖᤧᤶᤔᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ. ᤀᤠᤳᤋᤡᤸᤗᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤂᤡᤏᤡ᤹ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤧᤴᤗᤧᤰᤋᤡᤴᤗᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["ᤕᤖᤡᤰ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤴᤍᤢᤒᤠ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤧᤴ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ᤀᤣᤖᤥ ᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤔᤧᤒᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤢᤖ ᤀᤠᤔᤡᤱᤅᤥ ᤔᤧᤍᤠᤖᤥ. ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤕᤖᤡᤰ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ